    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Flying Dutchman</strong></i><strong>\u00a0is a pirate-themed, first-person mystery game set in the sky.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the realm of the Twilight Sea, after having made a fateful encounter with a mysterious force responsible for the recent disappearances of ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/68c5610b5d409423fce10489cfffb923.avif?t=1749152929\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Twilight Sea is home to an archipelago of floating islands, each distinct and unique in what they have to offer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cozier Approach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/802ba4be5203a13e229d0d172f9452d4.poster.avif?t=1749152929\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/802ba4be5203a13e229d0d172f9452d4.webm?t=1749152929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/802ba4be5203a13e229d0d172f9452d4.mp4?t=1749152929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story and adventure are put first, with intentional riddle solving, clue hunting, and interconnected mysteries. You can expect an adventure that's designed with the sole player in mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ten Thousand Leagues Above the Sea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/cfca2ee8fc2642b3718dc2bd0118aabf.poster.avif?t=1749152929\" width=800 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/cfca2ee8fc2642b3718dc2bd0118aabf.webm?t=1749152929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/cfca2ee8fc2642b3718dc2bd0118aabf.mp4?t=1749152929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skills to navigate and explore as a sky pirate will be tested. Avoid getting shot by cannons, caught by dungeon traps, and don't forget... falling is a long way down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help cute critters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/f63de4914f60946c5e1a3247b39bc425.avif?t=1749152929\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span>Your cold pirate heart is still capable of doing good every once in a while. Across the world, you'll meet small creatures whose way of life is threatened and need your help to survive.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Flying Dutchman</strong></i><strong>\u00a0is a pirate-themed, first-person mystery game set in the sky.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the realm of the Twilight Sea, after having made a fateful encounter with a mysterious force responsible for the recent disappearances of ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/68c5610b5d409423fce10489cfffb923.avif?t=1749152929\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Twilight Sea is home to an archipelago of floating islands, each distinct and unique in what they have to offer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cozier Approach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/802ba4be5203a13e229d0d172f9452d4.poster.avif?t=1749152929\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/802ba4be5203a13e229d0d172f9452d4.webm?t=1749152929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/802ba4be5203a13e229d0d172f9452d4.mp4?t=1749152929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story and adventure are put first, with intentional riddle solving, clue hunting, and interconnected mysteries. You can expect an adventure that's designed with the sole player in mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ten Thousand Leagues Above the Sea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/cfca2ee8fc2642b3718dc2bd0118aabf.poster.avif?t=1749152929\" width=800 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/cfca2ee8fc2642b3718dc2bd0118aabf.webm?t=1749152929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/cfca2ee8fc2642b3718dc2bd0118aabf.mp4?t=1749152929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skills to navigate and explore as a sky pirate will be tested. Avoid getting shot by cannons, caught by dungeon traps, and don't forget... falling is a long way down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help cute critters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692770/extras/f63de4914f60946c5e1a3247b39bc425.avif?t=1749152929\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span>Your cold pirate heart is still capable of doing good every once in a while. Across the world, you'll meet small creatures whose way of life is threatened and need your help to survive.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Flying Dutchman is a game about uncovering mysteries in a world of floating islands. Set sail as a skyfaring pirate, uncover secrets, and help out tiny sea creatures that need your help!",
